{"3499560": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "HMUR", "steam_appid": 3499560, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h1>WISHLIST NOW!</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3499560/extras/4b2b6a106034a83e416880826b4d0ed4.avif?t=1788170573\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3499560/extras_big/4b2b6a106034a83e416880826b4d0ed4.avif?t=1788170573 width=1560 height=438 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >HMUR is a fast-paced first-person shooter inspired by the hardcore gameplay of Hotline Miami, the Soviet industrial atmosphere of Atomic Heart, and the relentless action of DUSK.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight your way through hordes of enemies, explore the diverse areas of a facility consumed by chaos, and make your escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3499560/extras/906ec1560fffdf0b432cc893ac1522fc.poster.avif?t=1788170573\" width=1170 height=556 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3499560/extras/906ec1560fffdf0b432cc893ac1522fc.webm?t=1788170573\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3499560/extras/906ec1560fffdf0b432cc893ac1522fc.mp4?t=1788170573\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>GAMEPLAY</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>One life, endless attempts.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You and your enemies are equally vulnerable: one well-placed shot can kill either them or you. Dodge, maneuver, and rely on your reflexes to stay alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weapons are your best chance of survival, and sometimes you’ll get your hands on something truly powerful. But every round for these weapons is a precious resource.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Branching levels.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Levels are non-linear structures in which choosing a path directly impacts the flow of the game. Having trouble with one path? Pick another.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The world will speak if you are ready to listen.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interested in finding out what's going on? Learn more about the facility and its destruction by exploring levels, finding clues, audio recordings, and other details.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3499560/extras/e400f8f793bfe7ce93fe15c4dd38aab2.poster.avif?t=1788170573\" width=1170 height=556 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3499560/extras/e400f8f793bfe7ce93fe15c4dd38aab2.webm?t=1788170573\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3499560/extras/e400f8f793bfe7ce93fe15c4dd38aab2.mp4?t=1788170573\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WORLD OF THE GAME</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The action unfolds in an alternate 1990s version of USSR. The city of Mirnogorsk is located in the depths of Khakassia, a city that is the pride of the Union, a center of innovation and progress. The high-tech facilities of this city embodied the vision and hopes for a bright future of every citizen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yet, a tragic accident turned the pride of the Soviet Union into chaos, bringing the protagonist, Sergei, into the center of it. A mere utility worker with a challenging fate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3499560/extras/4c8b7f5b4ea03cff1f7f9b8dcc27a4fd.poster.avif?t=1788170573\" width=1170 height=556 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3499560/extras/4c8b7f5b4ea03cff1f7f9b8dcc27a4fd.webm?t=1788170573\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3499560/extras/4c8b7f5b4ea03cff1f7f9b8dcc27a4fd.mp4?t=1788170573\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast-paced, brutal combat.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Branching levels that let you choose your own path.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A soundtrack by Crypt Voice, composer for Cruel and the Hotline Miami Redux-Redux mod.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A wide variety of musical genres, including techno, hardbass, drum and bass, lounge, and more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Distinctive locations with contrasting visual styles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A large arsenal of weapons.</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >HMUR is a fast-paced first-person shooter inspired by the hardcore gameplay of Hotline Miami, the Soviet industrial atmosphere of Atomic Heart, and the relentless action of DUSK.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight your way through hordes of enemies, explore the diverse areas of a facility consumed by chaos, and make your escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3499560/extras/906ec1560fffdf0b432cc893ac1522fc.poster.avif?t=1788170573\" width=1170 height=556 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3499560/extras/906ec1560fffdf0b432cc893ac1522fc.webm?t=1788170573\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3499560/extras/906ec1560fffdf0b432cc893ac1522fc.mp4?t=1788170573\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>GAMEPLAY</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>One life, endless attempts.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You and your enemies are equally vulnerable: one well-placed shot can kill either them or you. Dodge, maneuver, and rely on your reflexes to stay alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weapons are your best chance of survival, and sometimes you’ll get your hands on something truly powerful. But every round for these weapons is a precious resource.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Branching levels.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Levels are non-linear structures in which choosing a path directly impacts the flow of the game. Having trouble with one path? Pick another.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The world will speak if you are ready to listen.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interested in finding out what's going on? Learn more about the facility and its destruction by exploring levels, finding clues, audio recordings, and other details.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3499560/extras/e400f8f793bfe7ce93fe15c4dd38aab2.poster.avif?t=1788170573\" width=1170 height=556 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3499560/extras/e400f8f793bfe7ce93fe15c4dd38aab2.webm?t=1788170573\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3499560/extras/e400f8f793bfe7ce93fe15c4dd38aab2.mp4?t=1788170573\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WORLD OF THE GAME</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The action unfolds in an alternate 1990s version of USSR. The city of Mirnogorsk is located in the depths of Khakassia, a city that is the pride of the Union, a center of innovation and progress. The high-tech facilities of this city embodied the vision and hopes for a bright future of every citizen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yet, a tragic accident turned the pride of the Soviet Union into chaos, bringing the protagonist, Sergei, into the center of it. A mere utility worker with a challenging fate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3499560/extras/4c8b7f5b4ea03cff1f7f9b8dcc27a4fd.poster.avif?t=1788170573\" width=1170 height=556 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3499560/extras/4c8b7f5b4ea03cff1f7f9b8dcc27a4fd.webm?t=1788170573\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3499560/extras/4c8b7f5b4ea03cff1f7f9b8dcc27a4fd.mp4?t=1788170573\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast-paced, brutal combat.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Branching levels that let you choose your own path.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A soundtrack by Crypt Voice, composer for Cruel and the Hotline Miami Redux-Redux mod.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A wide variety of musical genres, including techno, hardbass, drum and bass, lounge, and more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Distinctive locations with contrasting visual styles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A large arsenal of weapons.</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "Clock in. Survive the shift. HMUR is a brutal, fast-paced FPS where one shot can kill and ammo is precious. An ordinary factory 